<title>USA: Celesc to distribute 14.7 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Celesc to distribute 14.7 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centrais Eletricas de Santa Catarina SA said on Wednesday its board has proposed paying a dividend for the first time in seven years.</p>
<p>Celesc said a distribution of 14.7 million Brazilian reais will be proposed to shareholders at the company's annual meeting April 30.</p>
<p>Celesc said it reported a profit of 62.0 million reais (U.S. $59.6 million) for 1996, compared with a loss of 80.5 million reais in 1995.</p>
